**Key fields for connectivity dashboards:** `InterDeviceLinkAvailHealth`, `InterfaceLinkErrHealth`, `OverallHealth`, `IssueCount`, `Reachability`, `ReachabilityFailureReason`, `Site`, `Location`, `DeviceFamily`, `DeviceRole`, `DeviceSeries`, `Platform`.

**Field scales (FDEM-confirmed 2026-05-08):**

| Field | Scale | "No data" sentinel | Healthy direction |
|---|---|---|---|
| `InterDeviceLinkAvailHealth` | 0–100 (percent of links available) | `-1` or null | higher is better |
| `InterfaceLinkErrHealth` | 0–10 (DNAC health) | `-1` | higher is better |
| `OverallHealth` | 0–10 (DNAC health) | null | higher is better |
| `HealthScore` | 0–10 (DNAC health) | null | higher is better |
| `MemoryUtilizationHealth`, `CPUHealth` | 0–10 (DNAC health) | null | higher is better |
| `IssueCount` | unbounded count | null treated as 0 | lower is better |

When aggregating any health field, **filter `-1` first** to avoid poisoning averages:

```spl
avg(eval(if(InterDeviceLinkAvailHealth >= 0, InterDeviceLinkAvailHealth, null))) as avg_link_avail
```

Or pre-filter:

```spl
| where InterDeviceLinkAvailHealth >= 0
```

**Fields THAT DO NOT EXIST (don't reference them — common mistakes):**
- ❌ `InterfaceUtilizationPercent` — does not exist in FDEM TA
- ❌ `InterfaceLinkErrPercent24Hour` — does not exist; use `InterfaceLinkErrHealth` (a 0–10 score) instead
- ❌ `WANUtilization` — does not exist
- ❌ `AvgTrafficNorth` / `AvgTrafficSouth` — do not exist

